This adapter integrates with Hermes Agent (https://github.com/NousResearch/hermes-agent),
verified against tag v2026.9.24, commit f97608f178d1ffeca59860195ab7da295f7c8e5f
(hermes_cli.__version__ 0.21.5). No Hermes Agent source code is vendored or
redistributed here: the adapter calls Hermes' public plugin, hook and middleware
interfaces at runtime, and Hermes Agent is installed separately by the user.

